  "notes": "Name at release Mistral NeMo (the announcement also writes Mistral NeMO); the docs and changelog now write Mistral Nemo and Mistral Nemo 12B. Built in collaboration with NVIDIA (co-developer; NVIDIA's own post is src.nvidia.mistral-nemo-12b-announcement, which belongs in sources/nvidia.json). Also packaged as an NVIDIA NIM microservice on ai.nvidia.com, not recorded as cloud-partner access. The docs status badge still says Deprecated after the 2026-07-31 retirement given in the overview table."
